                url  : https://ymcanyc.org/locations/west-side-ymca  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : In the men's locker room, Jerry meets his idol, former New York Mets player Keith Hernandez — who goes on to woo Elaine and get confronted by Kramer and Newman, who accuse him of spitting on them after a crucial game in the 1987 World Series. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#38</styleUrl>
                <Point id="781">
                    <coordinates>-73.980684,40.770938,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
