                description  : Where Estelle convalesces after falling down in shock upon hearing a rumor that George is gay (not that there's anything wrong with that); where Kramer runs scared from the &quot;pig-man&quot; in room 1937 to the detriment of George's car; where Elaine's ex-boyfriend's touch-and-go surgery is a smashing success thanks to an errant Junior Mint. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#38</styleUrl>
