                url  : https://www.sothebys.com/en/about/locations/new-york  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Peterman sends Elaine here twice to bid on items for his collection of obscure memorabilia: first in &quot;The Bottle Deposit&quot; for a set of golf clubs that belonged to John F. Kennedy; later in &quot;The Frogger&quot; for a slice of cake from Edward VIII's wedding to Wallis Simpson. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
