                url  : https://www.theplazany.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Elaine reluctantly gives up her free suite here (given to her after lying that she was in from out of town on a job interview) to Jerry's parents, who really ''are'' in from out of town — and after they trash the room and ring up hundreds of dollars worth of extra charges, she's stuck with the bill! &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
