                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Where Elaine bargains hard for the last case of recently-recalled Today contraceptive sponges in the city. Still open as of December 2018, and &quot;The Sponge&quot; is back on the market, so buy as many as you want. &lt;br&gt;
