                description  : The setting of a pair of mishaps involving Elaine: in Season 3, she eliminates herself from &quot;The Contest&quot; after John F. Kennedy Jr. joins her aerobics class; in Season 6, she loans Mr. Pitt's tennis racket to a representative of Doubleday Publishing in hopes of landing a new job.{{anchor &lt;br&gt;
