                url  : https://improv.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The comedy club where Jerry delivered all the stand-up bits that opened and closed each episode of the first seven seasons — even after 1992, when the real-life one closed. If you want to catch a comedy show, The Improv is now a chain with locations in twenty cities nationwide (prominently ''ex''cluding New York); if you'd rather delve deeper into Seinfeldiana, the old location is now home to the '''Producers Club Theater''', starting point for the famous '''[[#Reality Tour &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
