                description  : The tiny Off-Broadway playhouse, part of Theatre Row, that ran ''Jerry Seinfeld Is the Devil'', a one-woman show written and performed by Susan's old roommate Sally Weaver, who claims Jerry has ruined her life. &lt;br&gt;
