                description  : The venue for the Able Mentally Challenged Adults benefit — where Kramer, whose slurred speech after a novocaine injection at the dentist led him to be mistaken for developmentally disabled, was the guest of honor — is also the place where Jerry's attempts to woo Miss Rhode Island (who was staying in Room 417) were constantly frustrated by her chaperone, Kramer, and where Mr. Lippman's press conference for Jake Jarmel's new book went awry. &lt;br&gt;
