                description  : In Season 7, Kramer got a personal behind-the-scenes tour of the Majestic's production of ''Joseph and the Amazing Technicolor Dreamcoat'' courtesy of Ethan, a friend of Susan's who was &quot;The Wig Master&quot; for the troupe. &lt;br&gt;
