                description  : Where Kramer, at the Tony Awards afterparty fresh off his &quot;win&quot; for the fictional ''Scarsdale Surprise'', is given an ultimatum by the musical's director: he can keep the statuette, but he has to be the one to fire the notoriously hotheaded Raquel Welch from the performance. &lt;br&gt;
