                description  : &quot;The Bookstore&quot; where Uncle Leo is caught shoplifting, and where George is forced to buy a book he doesn't want (and can't get rid of, as it's been &quot;flagged&quot;) after taking it to read in the men's room. (This was another continuity error on the writers' part: this location of Brentano's had already been closed for two years by the time the episode aired in 1998. The space is now a '''Lululemon''' clothing store.) &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#38</styleUrl>
