                description  : Theater where the titular performance of ''Pagliacci'' in &quot;The Opera&quot; was staged, to which all four have tickets for opening night. Jerry helps Elaine dodge her boyfriend/stalker, &quot;Crazy&quot; Joe Davola, while George and Kramer try to scalp their tickets. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
