                description  : Where, at an NBC showcase, Jerry intentionally bombs on stage to keep Kenny Bania, who's on next, from riding his coattails (&quot;He only does well when he has me for a lead-in. He's a time-slot hit.&quot;) Catch a Rising Star moved here from the [[#CARS &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
