                <description>
                category  : Filming locations and places featured on the show_New York City_Manhattan &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 148 Ninth Ave., Chelsea  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.downtownveterinaryclinic.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : &quot;I'll take a vet over an M.D. any day. They've got to be able to cure a lizard, a chicken, a pig, a frog — all on the same day.&quot; In &quot;The Andrea Doria&quot;, true to his words, Kramer finds a dog with the same cough he has and gets a vet from this office to prescribe medication. Later the site of the emergency surgery that saves the life of the squirrel George hit with his car in &quot;The Merv Griffin Show&quot;. The clinic moved up the street to 244 Ninth Ave.; this former location is vacant and for lease. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#38</styleUrl>
                <Point id="863">
                    <coordinates>-74.002861,40.744068,0.0</coordinates>
