                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Chef Bobby Flay's Spanish tapas house was the scene of three vexing dinners for the ''Seinfeld'' gang: one where Kramer chaperoned Miss Rhode Island's date with Jerry, to the latter's annoyance, and secured a job as her personal coach; one where George takes his cousin Rhisa on a date to get back at his parents for &quot;cutting him loose&quot;, and Jerry's second date with Christie, who always seems to wear the same outfit (&quot;What in God's name is going on here? Is she wearing the same thing over and over again, or does she have a closet full of these, like Superman?&quot;). Closed in 2008 and demolished, with luxury condos occupying the site now. &lt;br&gt;
