                description  : Where Jerry buys &quot;The Couch&quot; that Poppie ends up peeing on. Closed, but if you were hoping to take this opportunity to make like Jerry and upgrade your living room, you're in luck: the building is now the Chelsea branch showroom of '''[https://www.jensen-lewis.com/ Jensen-Lewis Furniture]'''. &lt;br&gt;
