                description  : &quot;The Tavern O. Henry Made Famous&quot; is also the tavern where Kramer stakes out &quot;The Sniffing Accountant&quot; — Jerry's, whose constant habit makes Kramer suspect he's a cocaine addict. &lt;br&gt;
