                description  : Jerry and George's favorite health club, where the latter is caught peeing in the shower in &quot;The Wife&quot;, and the former, curious to know if his girlfriend has breast implants, enlists Elaine to get in the sauna with her and &quot;do a little investigative journalism&quot;. &lt;br&gt;
