                url  : https://tools.usps.com/go/POLocatorDetailsAction!input.action?locationTypeQ &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The ''Seinfeld'' writers' favorite place to have characters get interrogated under hot lights: first Kramer in &quot;The Junk Mail&quot;, who has the audacity to want to stop receiving mail altogether, then Jerry, for attempted mail fraud in &quot;The Package&quot;, and finally George, who's accused of participating in &quot;some ill-conceived mail-order pornography ring.&quot;. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
