                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Where, in a desperate attempt to prove to his girlfriend Janet that he likes her for more than just her looks, George strains to find any conceivable reason for them to be together — and the best he can come up with is their shared love of chewing gum. The restaurant once co-owned by celebrity chef Mario Batali closed in 2017, but if you're hungry for Indian food, check out its successor, the West Village branch location of '''[http://www.drunkenmunkey.com The Drunken Munkey]'''. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#38</styleUrl>
