                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : This legendary record shop was the ''Seinfeld'' stand-in for '''Ron's Records''', where Kramer and Newman flatly refused the owner's offer of five dollars for a box of records Jerry took from the apartment of Sid, &quot;The Old Man&quot; for whom he'd signed up to do volunteer work. (&quot;'Take it or leave it'? We got Al Jolson here. ''Al Jolson!''&quot;) Closed in 2013, now a sushi restaurant. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#38</styleUrl>
