                address  : 64 E. 4th St., East Village  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://iatitheater.org/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : In &quot;The Movie&quot;, the gang head to this downtown movie house to catch ''CheckMate'', but — stuck at the end of a long, slow line — they give up and end up seeing ''Rochelle, Rochelle'' (&quot;a young woman's strange, erotic journey from [[Milan]] to [[Minsk]]&quot;). &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#38</styleUrl>
                <Point id="911">
