                address  : 14 N. Moore St., [[Manhattan/TriBeCa &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : In &quot;The Secret Code&quot;, Kramer stops by to share his favorite shortcuts through Greenwich Village and the West Side, only to demonstrate his knowledge of the street grid firsthand behind the wheel of a fire truck en route to a burning building. Outside the ''Seinfeld'' universe, Hook &amp; Ladder No. 8 is best known as the ''Ghostbusters''&lt;nowiki&gt;'&lt;/nowiki&gt; firehouse headquarters.  &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#38</styleUrl>
