                url  : http://www.nycourts.gov/courts/nyc/criminal/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Where Newman's attempt to talk his way out of a traffic ticket is derailed by Kramer, who's still reeling from the concussion &quot;Crazy&quot; Joe Davola gave him in &quot;The Pitch&quot;, and where Jackie Chiles cribs from Johnnie Cochran's &quot;if the glove doesn't fit&quot; defense in &quot;The Caddy&quot;, with disastrous results for Kramer's lawsuit against the &quot;braless wonder&quot;, Sue Ellen Mischke. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
