                category  : Filming locations and places featured on the show_New York City_Manhattan &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 80 Centre St., Civic Center  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Elaine heads here in &quot;The Pilot&quot; to file an &quot;equal employment opportunity&quot; complaint against Monk's Cafe for only hiring large-breasted waitresses (still another continuity error; the EEOC is a federal agency and thus the complaint would not have been heard at the state level); also where Kramer picked up his &quot;ASSMAN&quot; vanity license plates in &quot;The Fusilli Jerry&quot;. The Lefkowitz Building is now home to the New York City Marriage Licensing Bureau, and under threat of demolition. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
