                url  : https://www.fairmont.com/los-angeles/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A suite at this landmark luxury hotel was the venue for the casting session at which Michael Richards (an avid practitioner of yoga) landed the role of Kramer by reading his scenes while standing on his head. If you'd like to sleep where that happened, best to have deep pockets: as of September 2023, rates start at $830/night for a studio suite and go (way) up from there.{{anchor &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
