                url  : https://www.jerrysdeli.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : After a full week of writing, rehearsing and filming, the cast of ''Seinfeld'' were famous for unwinding on Friday evenings at the Studio City location of this famous chain of New York-style Jewish delis, eating, talking, and joking together late into the night. Ask the staff and (if it's not too busy) you can see their favorite booth, now marked with a plaque. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
