                url  : http://www.nycroads.com/crossings/brooklyn  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : From its intersection with Park Row (just east of City Hall) you can walk (takes about 20-30 minutes each way), bike, or drive across the historic and iconic bridge to Brooklyn. The view from the bridge is quite lovely, with excellent views of Lower Manhattan and [[Brooklyn/Downtown &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
