            <Placemark id="1178">
                <name>Hilton Garden Inn New York/Tribeca </name>
                <description>
                category  : Sleep &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 39 Avenue of the America  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : https://hiltongardeninn3.hilton.com/en/hotels/new-york/hilton-garden-inn-new-york-tribeca-NYCTRGI/index.html  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The Garden Inn has a slightly dated chain hotel feel, but a reasonably nice restaurant and a strategic location. Rooms feature the usual conveniences found in midscale hotels, enhanced with a microwave and fridge that could be convenient for self-caterers, who will also find a hotel &quot;pantry&quot; with convenience food items for sale in the lobby. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#94</styleUrl>
                <Point id="1177">
                    <coordinates>-74.00556,40.72086,0.0</coordinates>
