                url  : http://www.lfstores.com  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : LF Stores is not very big or well known, but it carries some unique items, such that celebrities have shopped here. The prices are a little bit on the high side, depending on the item  for example, shirts cost about $50-200. The service is wonderful, and the staff is very helpful. Aside from clothing, there are such accessories as jewelry, scarfs, hats, and shoes. The outside of the narrow building is tan, and there is a doorman. &lt;br&gt;
