                url  : https://www.ilcorallotrattoria.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Il Corallo offers an extensive menu of pasta, pizza, antipasto, and salads. You will find unfamiliar yet tasty dishes. It's a small, unpretentious place with efficient, friendly service. Both locals and visitors dine here. &lt;br&gt;
