                <description>
                category  : Buy_Book stores &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 52 Prince St  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://mcnallyjackson.com  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Formerly McNally Robinson Booksellers, this independent bookstore features an extensive collection of magazines, fiction, and nonfiction. The store also features a cafe, as well as a number of ongoing events, signings, book clubs and discussion groups. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#166</styleUrl>
                <Point id="1251">
                    <coordinates>-73.9961,40.7233,0.0</coordinates>
