                url  : http://2bridgesnyc.net/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : 2 Bridges Music Arts sells new and used records, tapes and books while staging exhibitions and events from their post in a Chinatown mall. The space is meant to host overlapping tendencies in experimental music, art and knowledge production internationally. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
