                url  : http://www.websterhall.com  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : This large, beautiful, landmarked dance and event hall with three performance venues dates from 1886. It was closed for renovations starting in 2017 but reopened on April 26, 2019 with a concert by Jay-Z. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
