                url  : http://bhphotovideo.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Perhaps the best camera and photography equipment store in New York, this is the place to go for any of the cameras and camera accessories you might want. The selection is good and the staff is knowledgeable and willing to discuss things with you. It is owned and heavily staffed by Hasidic Jews, so it is closed on Friday nights, Saturdays, and all Jewish holidays except for Hanukkah. B&amp;H provides its holiday closing schedule [http://www.bhphotovideo.com/find/HelpCenter/HoursOfOperation.jsp here]. &lt;br&gt;
