                url  : http://www.elmorestaurant.com  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A very trendy spot. Filled with chic comfort food, delicious cocktails, and beautiful people. They have a main floor dining room as well as a downstairs lounge perfect for any event and complete with a DJ booth, sound system and full bar. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
