                url  : http://www.nypl.org/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The main branch of the New York Public Library (the Stephen A. Schwarzman Building), this is the grand structure flanked by lions on both sides of the entrance. Inside you'll see impressive architecture, long hallways, and beautifully designed reading rooms. &lt;br&gt;
