                category  : See_Parks &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A private park open only to immediate area residents and guests at hotels on the perimeter who have access to keys to the gate. However, anyone can walk around the park, look in through the fence and look at the beautiful old buildings across the street from it on every side. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
