                <description>
                category  : Eat &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 101 E 19th St  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://unionsquarecafe.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : One of New York's best-loved restaurants, serving great American and Italian cuisine with flair and crisp style. Osso buco, tuna burgers, roast vegetables and corn pudding are fine examples of the dishes created using the best local and seasonal produce from the café's neighbor, the Union Square Farmers' Market. Mains in excess of $30 average. Reservations recommended. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#78</styleUrl>
                <Point id="1715">
                    <coordinates>-73.99106,40.73679,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
