                url  : http://www.vatanny.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A prix-fixe vegetarian Indian restaurant with wonderful food. The decor is a little hokey, but the food makes it worthwhile. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#78</styleUrl>
                <Point id="1717">
