                address  : 1073 Avenue of the Americas (6th Ave)  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : https://usa.kinokuniya.com/stores-kinokuniya-new-york  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A Japanese book dealer, carrying a huge selection of Japanese reading material. It also sells a number of books by Japanese authors in English translation. It is also known as a source of excellent Japanese anime and manga, much of which is difficult or impossible to find anywhere else in the United States. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#166</styleUrl>
                <Point id="1795">
                    <coordinates>-73.98506,40.75408,0.0</coordinates>
