                url  : http://www.mymms.com/merchandise  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : You can purchase all types of M&amp;M goodies and M&amp;M-themed trinkets here. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#166</styleUrl>
                <Point id="1797">
                    <coordinates>-73.98437,40.76019,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="1800">
                <name>Midtown Comics </name>
                <description>
                category  : Buy &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 200 W 40th St  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.midtowncomics.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : An absolutely gigantic comic book store, one of the largest and most well-known in the country, with two full floors of comics, collectibles, manga, and back issues, as well as a very knowledgeable staff. Signings by giants in the comic book industry are a regular occurrence here and the store also sponsors the annual New York Comic Con held every October. Smaller locations can be found in Midtown East and the Financial District. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#166</styleUrl>
