                <name>Heckscher Playground </name>
                <description>
                category  : Do_Playgrounds &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.centralparknyc.org/things-to-see-and-do/attractions/heckscher-playground.html  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Central Park's largest playground, Heckscher is unique among Central Park's playgrounds in that it is not on the boundaries of the park. The playground has a range of play equipment, including a large water feature. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#150</styleUrl>
