                url  : https://mokjanyc.com/ &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Counter-served Korean cheap comfort food, featuring an array of dishes including bibimbap, kimchi rice, and noodles in a contemporary, quaint setting. Various options of customization are featured which makes the dishes even more full of Korean flavor.  &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
