                <description>
                category  : Eat_Mid-range &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 1534 3rd Avenue &lt;br&gt;
                url  :  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Low-key space with traditional Japanese art installations features a variety of dumpling, poke, ramen, and sushi dishes in an authentic yet comfortable environment with an endless array of customization. The food is fresh and is accompanied by authentic drinks and choices of sides such as fried chicken and takoyaki. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#86</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2137">
                    <coordinates>-73.95396,40.779171,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
