                url  : http://www.heidelberg-nyc.com  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : German-style schnitzel and beer at an authentic 1936 beer garden in Yorkville, the historically German neighborhood of Manhattan's Upper East Side. Gulasch, sauerbrauten, sausage, schnitzel, and schweinebraten can be found here. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#86</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2141">
