                url  : https://levainbakery.com/pages/upper-east-side  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Levain is chock full of classic desserts such as double chocolate cookies and banana bread with chocolate chips. However, don't expect your average bakery here, as specialty yet finger-licking items are sold for fairly moderate prices here. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#86</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2143">
