                description  : A branch of a fairly large city-wide chain of French pastry shops. The bakery here is full of elegant breads, cookies, pastries, and take-out pasta and salad dishes. The pastries here are elegant and garnished with care. Meanwhile, the restaurant next door features classics like french toasts and omelettes. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
