                address  : 853 Lexington Avenue  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.seletpoivrenyc.com  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A French restaurant with Spanish waiters serves international food. The bar has a good choice of wines alongside a unique mix between classic choices such as mashed potatoes and beef with new, modern takes meaning this restaurant is an ideal choice for any diner who likes to splurge a little. &lt;br&gt;
