                url  : https://bondurantsnyc.com/ &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Delicious, rustic brunch spot by day and unique cocktails draft beers by night, this spot is ideal for everyone. The food here is based on classical dishes such as steak and eggs but is specialized with delicious garnishes that make this place unique and a great spot for anyone looking for either a relaxing place to rest during the day or a crazy party at midnight. &lt;br&gt;
