                url  : http://www.hotelwalesnyc.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : European style boutique hotel with numerous accommodations, free WiFi, paid parking, and elegant rooms with careful designs even for the cheapest traveler. Hotel Wales also prides itself on being an LGBTQ+ friendly hotel and has historically contributed to the movement. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
