                description  : Full concierge assistance, elevator attendants, and beautifully furnished rooms are all present at this fairly small but decadent hotel that has beautiful views and is within walking distance of both many bustling destinations along with Central Park. Amazing for visitors who have a bit more cash to spend. &lt;br&gt;
