                <name>Book Culture </name>
                <description>
                category  : Buy &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 536 W 112th St  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.bookculture.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Formerly known as Labyrinth Books, Book Culture is a scholarly bookstore, worth browsing for the books on science and the liberal arts. The sale tables on the second floor are full of bargains that will delight any booklover. &lt;br&gt;
