                <description>
                category  : Eat_Budget &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 764 Amsterdam Ave  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://maleconrestaurants.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A Dominican restaurant known as one of the best places for ''pollo a la brasa'' (rotisserie chicken) in Manhattan. They also serve a number of daily specials for lunch and dinner. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#82</styleUrl>
