                url  : http://grayspapayanyc.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : One of the best hot dog joints in Manhattan (the &quot;Recession Special&quot; is a popular favorite), Gray's also serves up some excellent tropical drinks. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#82</styleUrl>
