                <name>Per Se </name>
                <description>
                category  : Eat_Splurge &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 10 Columbus Circle  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.thomaskeller.com/per-se  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The New York outpost of Chef Thomas Keller of the French Laundry in Yountville, which is in the Napa Valley of California. Chef Keller is one of the most famous and highly praised chefs in the United States. It used to be necessary to call months in advance for reservations, but same-day reservations may be worth attempting. &lt;br&gt;
