                url  : http://kitabkhana.in  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Very good bookshop with a large selection of Indian and international literature in English. Some Hindi books. Non-fiction also, plus a children's corner. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#166</styleUrl>
