            <Placemark id="2674">
                <name>Cafe Mondegar </name>
                <description>
                category  : Drink &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Colaba Causeway  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Mondy's, as it's popularly called, serves excellent pitchers of Kingfisher, and at rock-bottom prices. Beer and wine are the only alcohols on the menu. Has a live jukebox and functions as a bar (beer and wine served) and restaurant. Food is a mix of Indian, Continental and Parsi, and the ambience is fun and low-key. Variety of TVs around showing sports games. Again extremely popular with local college kids. Suffers from a regrettable tendency to cram as many tables into a small space as possible and sports a stereo system whose power isn't flattered by the echoey acoustics. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
