                    <coordinates>72.80557,18.97319,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="2746">
                <name>Chor Bazaar </name>
                <description>
                category  : Buy_Markets &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Bhandarwada Ln  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A colloquial term used to refer to a place selling stolen items. It consists of a number of interconnecting by-lanes with street vendors hawking a wide variety of items from antiques to shoes to car accessories etc. The place can be quite a surprise for the number and type of items on sale. A great place to spot bargains, and bargaining is a must. Shop with a keen eye: look out for fakes or second-hand items that are shoddily repaired and can be passed out for a quick buck. Don’t carry too many items like money, jewellery and watches on you when visit the market. Keep it to the bare essentials and keep an eye on your belongings. There is a very good chance that you may get robbed since locals are apt at spotting first-time shoppers. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#166</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2745">
                    <coordinates>72.827079,18.960319,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="2748">
                <name>Dava Bazaar </name>
                <description>
                category  : Buy_Markets &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Famous for medical and scientific instruments and lab chemicals. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#166</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2747">
                    <coordinates>72.831362,18.946882,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
