            <Placemark id="2762">
                <name>A Patil Flyover </name>
                <description>
                category  : See &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar Rd, Byculla  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Byculla is also known for Mumbai's first Y-shaped bridge built across Dr Babasaheb Ambedkar Road which then splits further to go to Byculla East and West before the Clare Road intersection, thereby forming a Y shape when seen from the air. This was one of the oldest flyovers built in Mumbai. &lt;br&gt;
