            <Placemark id="2804">
                <name>Nehru Planetarium </name>
                <description>
                category  : Do &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Dr. Edwin Moses Road, Worli  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.nehru-centre.org/planetarium/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : This is next door to the Nehru Science Centre and has some interesting shows. Over the years, it has grown into a centre for the scientific study of astronomy and space science. The planetarium is equipped with a Digistar 3 planetarium projector which was installed in 2003. &lt;br&gt;
