            <Placemark id="2812">
                <name>Atria mall </name>
                <description>
                category  : Buy_Malls &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 2A/1, Dr Annie Besant Rd, Worli  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : One of the nicest, best maintained malls in the city. For upscale there's Mango, Nine West, Aldo, Promod, Guess, La Senza (all sold at slightly inflated prices in India). There's also your regular Nike, Reebok, Levi's, along with some cheaper local brands. Be sure to check out the Rolls Royce dealership next door. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#166</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2811">
                    <coordinates>72.81441,18.99141,0.0</coordinates>
