            <Placemark id="2824">
                <name>Hard Rock Cafe </name>
                <description>
                category  : Drink &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : More club-like than most other Hard Rock Cafes worldwide. Packed with the post-office media crowd (usually between 20-30 years old), with a fair share of expats. Drinks ₹300 up. Thursdays band nights. Don't expect to get a table for a while if you go after 11PM. This place is usually packed with office folk on weekdays and plays older music. Expect your Zeppelin, Hendrix, REM, etc.  &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#58</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2823">
                    <coordinates>2.3415791,48.8719298,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
