            <Placemark id="2828">
                <name>Shiro </name>
                <description>
                category  : Drink &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : It is a beautiful bar, modeled after Buddha Bar. Shiro does some fabulous sushi on one day and yet somehow can mess it up so bad on another. Retro nights on Fridays are always packed to bursting, and it usually stays open til 3AM on weekends. Cocktails are ₹300 up. Alcoholic Sunday brunch.  &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
