            <Placemark id="2830">
                <name>Four Seasons </name>
                <description>
                category  : Sleep_Splurge &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 114, Dr. E. Moses Rd, Worli  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.fourseasons.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Mumbai's swankiest hotel. This is a five-star hotel and part of the Toronto-based Four Seasons luxury hotels and resorts. The hotel has 202 guest rooms and also offers India's highest rooftop bar. Restaurants at the hotel: café Prato &amp; Bar, Pool Deck, San-Qi. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
