            <Placemark id="2832">
                <name>ITC Grand Central </name>
                <description>
                category  : Sleep_Splurge &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 287, Dr Babasaheb Ambedkar Rd, Parel  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : https://www.itchotels.com/in/en/itcgrandcentral-mumbai  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : This extremely posh hotel is also suitably expensive. '''Kebabs and Curries Restaurant''': Spectacular Indian food. They serve the famous Delhi Bukhara curry at this ITC restaurant. Try their succulent kebabs, their thick-enough-to-cut dal bukhara, or their fantastic Indian breads. Expect to empty out your wallets at this place, each dish can be ₹1000. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#106</styleUrl>
