                <description>
                category  : See &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Swatantrya Veer Savarkar Marg, Dadar W  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The official residence of the Mayor of Mumbai and the famous Sena Bhavan, headquarters of the political party Shiv Sena. &lt;br&gt;
