                url  : http://www.ramada.com  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Ramada Plaza Palm, Juhu Beach, Mumbai ''+91 22'' 2611 2323, is a place that offers surprisingly great ambiance and some really economical beer. The service is good and they have a live band in the evenings (7PM-11PM). Happy hour (about 25% discount on food and beverage) extends up to 7PM. The crowd is fairly decent and includes a fair sprinkling of Europeans in the evenings. (Expect to spend about ₹120 ($3) for a beer (+ complimentary snacks) and ₹180 - ₹270 ($4 - $6) for add on snacks to go with the beer. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
