            <Placemark id="3054">
                <name>Essel World </name>
                <description>
                category  : Do &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Global Pagoda Road, Gorai Creek, western coast of Borivali  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.esselworld.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : It is an amusement park. There are 34 major rides not to include the coin operated games &amp; a mini club. There are over 30,000 specimens in their botanical gardens and 79 rides and slides &amp; Essel World attracts almost 1.8 million visitors each year. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
